// EXPECT-ERROR: value 64 does not fit in intensity, which is u8 <= 63
// EXPECT-AT: 8:21
// A unit is program-wide (§39), so this const may be typed with one declared
// in a file included below it. The range has to be known here anyway: ranges
// are registered before any declaration is resolved, and a range registered
// where its declaration stood would let this through without a word (§75).

const intensity k = 64
include "inc/intensity.momo"
